# taste-skill working files
# Generated screenshots, stitched inspector sheets and inspection reports are
# review-process artifacts and are never committed. The capture scripts and
# LOCAL_MODIFICATIONS.md under .taste-skill/ are kept.
.taste-skill/inspect/
.taste-skill/inspect-*/
.taste-skill/real-shots/
.taste-skill/real-shots-*/
.taste-skill/review-shots/
.taste-skill/*-shots/
.taste-skill/**/*.jpg
.taste-skill/**/*.jpeg
.taste-skill/**/*.png
.taste-skill/**/*.webp
.taste-skill/**/shots.json
.taste-skill/**/report.json
.taste-skill/**/*.log

